#EXTINF:-1 tvg-name="Your Personal Taxi" tvg-logo="https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/642/1606513.jpg" tvg-country="KR" tvg-description="Ülke: Güney Kore | Yıl: 2026 | Tür: Drama, Music | Durum: Ended | There are times when all we want is for someone to truly listen to our story. And sometimes, we come across a song that feels like it's telling that story for us. Welcome to Your Personal Taxi —a special ride where music plays alongside memories, and your story is met with a listening ear. This isn't just any car—it's a personalized classic, and there's something quietly mysterious about it. Passengers with ordinary yet extraordinary lives step in to share personal stories, along with the songs that carry their emotions. | Bilgi kaynağı: TVmaze" group-title="🩷◆ HANIM KORE DİZİLERİ ⭕",Your Personal Taxi
