#EXTINF:-1 tvg-name="Winter Season" tvg-logo="https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/1627917.jpg" tvg-country="KR" tvg-description="Ülke: Güney Kore | Yıl: 2026 | Tür: Drama, Romance | Durum: In Development | Nine years after their last encounter, Koo Seung Hyeok and Kwon I Hyeon unexpectedly reunite at Nexus, a nightclub linked to organized crime. Seung Hyeok, now the club manager, confronts I Hyeon, who works in lowly conditions, leading to a series of hostile interactions rooted in past grievances. When I Hyeon's father is diagnosed with cancer, he reluctantly re-engages with Seung Hyeok under a work and debt agreement. This forced collaboration ignites complex emotions, as hatred and fixation intertwine. As both men grapple with their tumultuous history—Seung Hyeok's contempt and I Hyeon's struggle with vulnerability—they face the choice between continued conflict or an unforeseen future together. | Bilgi kaynağı: TVmaze" group-title="🩷◆ HANIM KORE DİZİLERİ ⭕",Winter Season
https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/95468/winter-season
